         Immutable Home Router (bootc / Fedora)
========================================================================
 * Core OS Status:     bootc status
 * Upgrade Staging:    bootc upgrade [--apply]
 * Rollback Version:   bootc rollback && systemctl reboot
 * Firewall Ruleset:   nft list ruleset
 * DHCP / DNS Leases:  cat /var/lib/dnsmasq/dnsmasq.leases
 * Cockpit Console:    https://<LAN-IP>:9090
